1625ms)\n✔ a hostile pre-populated shared dedup state cannot falsely suppress a fresh identity (0.112167ms)\n✔ concurrent transforms reserve delivery before commit so only one may deliver (0.103417ms)\n✔ consecutive signatures over unchanged files hash each source file once (17.744875ms)\n✔ changing one source file changes the signature without rehashing unchanged files (13.901458ms)\nℹ tests 42\nℹ suites 0\nℹ pass 42\nℹ fail 0\nℹ cancelled 0\nℹ skipped 0\nℹ todo 0\nℹ duration_ms 1505.165667\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"✔ session deletion prevents an in-flight completion from repopulating cache (5.835292ms)\n✔ concurrent unique advisor lookups keep at most two CLI children live (8.854625ms)\n✔ a queued lookup fails open at its queue deadline while the granted runs stay live (413.732458ms)\n✔ a queued lookup for a deleted session fails open on deletion (8.755958ms)\n✔ a queue deadline leaves both slots free for later lookups (428.135541ms)\n✔ a slot freed past a waiter deadline fails the lookup open without spawning (38.400875ms)\n✔ cache TTL starts when CLI work completes (84.549542ms)\n✔ unexpected spawn failures fail open without escaping the transform (4.581542ms)\n✔ hostile output containers cannot make the transform fail closed (1.702958ms)\n✔ Claude source clamps prompts, keeps fallback parity, and flushes fail-open output (0.886708ms)\n✔ status exposes prompt-safe configuration health (1.608666ms)\n✔ same-message advisor contributions are suppressed only after the first delivery (3.714875ms)\n✔ distinct advisor messages with identical text both receive full delivery (4.003542ms)\n✔ flag-off advisor delivery preserves repeated output byte-for-byte (4.3945ms)\n✔ unresolvable advisor identity fails open with full delivery (3.901208ms)\n✔ malformed advisor identity fields resolve to no identity without throwing (0.264083ms)\n✔ identity parts carrying the key separator